  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Disaster Risk Governance for Resilience in African Regions and Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action intends to strengthen disaster risk governance for resilience in African regions and countries to contribute to creating enabling policy environment that will facilitate implementation of DRR Programmes in RECs and Member States. The DRR actions that will be implemented will directly or indirectly contribute to reduced risks and building resilience.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
